<title>USA: DDJ group raises stake in Ames Department.</title>
<headline>DDJ group raises stake in Ames Department.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by DDJ Capital Management LLC said it raised its stake in Ames Department Stores Inc to 2,202,650 shares, or 9.87 percent of the shares outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought 238,000 additional common shares between July 16 and August 14 at an aggregate price of $597,035.</p>
